       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-HOGAN-SSA-TEDDY_BEAR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-HOGAN-SSA-TEDDY_BEAR-PROOFS.
           05  WS-DNA-SSA-BRIDGE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ENDOWMENT-CREDIT-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PKI-AUTH-MATRIX-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BRIDGE-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HOGAN-TEDDY_BEAR-SEAL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-HOGAN-TEDDY_BEAR-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-HGN-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-HGN-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DNA-AND-ENDOW.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-PKI-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-HGN-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DNA-AND-ENDOW.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DNA-SSA-BRIDGE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ENDOWMENT-CREDIT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-PKI-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PKI-AUTH-MATRIX-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BRIDGE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-HGN-PROOFS.
           IF WS-DNA-SSA-BRIDGE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ENDOWMENT-CREDIT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PKI-AUTH-MATRIX-OK = 1 AND
              WS-BRIDGE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-HOGAN-TEDDY_BEAR-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-HGN-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-HGN-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-HGN-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-HGN-CODE.
